                     rel in the presence of adenine nucleotides capping it; fol
                     ding of unfolded substrates initiates in a GroEL-substrate
                      bound and capped by GroES; release of the folded substrat
                     e is dependent on ATP binding and hydrolysis in the trans 
                     ring"
